s($,"bnY","aZf",()=>{var q="Digital Agency by Chandan Das",p="Just now",o="all",n="2 hours ago"
return new A.T0(A.b([A.vG(o,"Respected Sir,\n\nWe are happy to inform you that a major update has just been rolled out across the ONECONECT apps, covering the changes you requested. Here is what is new:\n\nSECURE LOGIN\nVendor and Rider login now works with Mobile Number + Email OTP only - no password required, giving every login an extra layer of protection. The Vendor Registration form has also been simplified as you asked.\n\nNEW SERVICE BOOKING FORMS\nComplete, dedicated booking forms are now live for Rental, Education, Entertainment and Healthcare - each one built specifically for that service, with its own fields, document upload and live pricing.\n\nRENTAL TRIP FLOW\nA full Start Trip / End Trip process has been added for rentals, with vehicle photo upload and a secure OTP handshake between the customer and the vendor at both ends of the trip.\n\nRIDER VERIFICATION\nA new Aadhaar and PAN verification screen has been added to the Rider profile, fully ready to connect with your chosen verification provider as soon as it is finalised.\n\nAND MORE\nOrder and booking screens, payout messages, the service on/off status and several other sections have all been updated exactly as discussed in your requirement list.\n\nOUR REQUEST TO YOU\nPlease take a few minutes to go through the updated apps and share your feedback with us - anything you would like changed, added or removed. Your review means a lot to us and helps us move even faster on what is left.\n\nThank you for trusting us with your project - we look forward to hearing from you.\n\nWarm regards,\nChandan Das\nDigital Agency by Chandan Das\ndigitalagencybychandandas.in",4286331629,q,B.U7,p,"Big update! New features are live - your review awaited"),A.vG(o,"Respected Sir,\n\nThe front-end of all three ONECONECT apps is now ready for your review. Every screen, every booking form and the full flow are working, so you can use the apps exactly the way your customers, vendors and delivery partners will.\n\nREQUEST\nKindly go through the apps once and share your feedback with us - anything you want changed in the design, wording, prices, services or the order flow. Please also tell us if any feature is missing.\n\nWHY IT MATTERS NOW\nAs soon as we receive your feedback and your approval, we will start the backend work - database, real login with OTP, live orders between the three apps, payment gateway, notifications and the admin panel. Getting the screens final before that saves both time and cost, because any change made after the backend is connected takes much longer.\n\nSo kindly send your feedback at your earliest convenience and we will begin the next phase immediately.\n\nRegards,\nChandan Das\nDigital Agency by Chandan Das\ndigitalagencybychandandas.in",4279118428,q,B.Ud,p,"Your feedback needed - backend work will start next"),A.vG(o,"Respected Sir,\n\nWork on your ONECONECT project is going on well. All three apps - Customer, Vendor and Delivery Partner - are being built and improved step by step, and new screens and features are added regularly.\n\nPlease keep checking the apps and go through every section at your convenience. If you need any change anywhere, or want a new feature added, kindly share your feedback with us - we will do it for you.\n\nThank you for trusting us with this project.\n\nRegards,\nChandan Das\nDigital Agency by Chandan Das\ndigitalagencybychandandas.in",4294212384,q,B.eC,"5 min ago","Development update - all 3 ONECONECT apps"),A.vG(o,"Enter your 6 digit PIN code and the area fills in by itself. If we do not serve your area yet, the app tells you right away and you can ask to be informed when we open there.",4279416682,"",B.e7,"10 min ago","Book any service with your PIN code"),A.vG("user","Ride, Parcel, Tuition, Events, Entertainment, Healthcare, Pharmacy and Home Services - every one of them now has its own complete booking form with live price calculation.",4279150057,"",B.TD,"1 hour ago","New booking forms are live"),A.vG("vendor","Turn a category on to go live, or off to pause it. Customers see your status instantly in their app.",4278884931,"",B.eB,n,"Keep your services updated"),A.vG("rider","Use the barcode scanner at pickup and delivery, and collect cash or show the UPI QR at the door. Your earnings update instantly.",4278671064,"",B.e6,n,"Scan, deliver, get paid")],A.aP("E<vF>")),$.a5())})
